{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_christ_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_christ_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"很久很久以前","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"新出生的小王子似乎能看到那只传说中的“黑猫”，接下来，会有什么样的命运等待着他？","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_christ_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["神秘优雅的生物","婴儿","惊喜的仆从们","王后","国王","国王的弟弟","小王子","议论纷纷的人们","前王后","新国王","奇异的鬼魂","门外的声音","惊慌的大臣","紧张的群众","紧张的士兵","惊慌的士兵","？？？","卢西恩","神秘美丽的生物"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_bg_nobleD.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"很久很久以前，在大地上流传着一个“黑猫”的传说。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"据说，只有被选中的人才能看到祂，祂会带来爱与幸福，并惩罚作恶的人；也有人更愿意相信，“黑猫”不祥，祂会为人们带来厄运。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"但黑猫只是随着自己的心意四处走走看看，累了，就停在某处睡觉。","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"喵~","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"（慵懒地打哈欠）","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"（放松地伸懒腰）","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#4$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"呼喵......呼......呼......","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#4$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"呼......","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"今天，祂被一阵突如其来的吵嚷声打扰了午睡。","id":25},{"type":"charslot","id":26},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"呜哇啊——！！","id":28},{"type":"charslot","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"呜哇哇哇——！！呜呜呜——哇！！！","id":30},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#8$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"——！","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的仆从们","text":"天啊，是小王子，王后诞下了一位小王子！","id":34},{"type":"charslot","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的仆从们","text":"快，快告诉国王，快告诉外面等着的所有人，是个可爱健康的小王子！","id":36},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"charslot","id":38},{"type":"text","text":"一连几天过去，仆从们拿来鲜花装点宫殿，庆祝新生儿诞生的庆典就此拉开帷幕。","id":39},{"type":"text","text":"国王与王后沐浴着阳光，接受着来往宾客的祝福。","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫从午休的窗台离开，祂看到一双，完完全全沉浸于幸福中的眼睛。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"王后","text":"哦......可爱的小家伙，我又看到你了。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"王后","text":"这仍旧是我们之间的小秘密，对吗？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"呜喵~","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"text","text":"以及一双，幸福中掺杂着些许忧虑的眼睛。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王","text":"......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王","text":"（我仍旧能看到祂......希望我的儿子能够健康快乐地长大，不受到任何的伤害......）","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"国王心中那丝酸涩的忧虑指引着黑猫，祂扭过头，看到一个正高举着酒杯的人。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"哈哈哈哈，祝福，祝福！让我们一起举杯，祝福我们的国王与王后，还有新生的小王子，祝福他们的生活幸福长久！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"呜呜......呜呜......","id":61},{"type":"charslot","id":62},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"呜哇啊——！！","id":64},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫摇晃着双尾，轻轻跃到了婴儿的摇篮上。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"国王与王后并没有阻止，其他的人似乎都无法看到祂，但襁褓中本在嚎啕的小王子却咯咯地笑了起来。","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"他伸出手，试图抓住黑猫垂下的双尾。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"（流着口水笑）","id":71},{"type":"charslot","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"（想把尾巴塞进嘴里）","id":73},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"呜喵？","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"（远远地跳开）","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"——嗯？......“呜喵”！","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"婴儿","text":"......“喵喵”......“喵喵”！","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的仆从们","text":"啊，是那个传说，那个有关“黑猫”的传说......","id":83},{"type":"charslot","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的仆从们","text":"小王子能看到那个传说中优雅而美丽的生物，那个只有被选中的人才能看到的生物！","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊喜的仆从们","text":"希望祂能为小王子带来爱与幸福......！","id":87},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":89},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":93},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_bg_bg_nobleN.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":96,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"十几年后。","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","duration":"2","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——不！不可能！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"父亲是一位如同神明一样伟大的君王，他怎么会突然之间变成一具尸体，躺在这冰冷的棺椁之中？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"叔父，叔父！我在外游学，母亲因为太过悲痛而陷入昏迷，您能告诉我，这段时间究竟发生了什么事吗？为什么父亲会变成这样？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"......我亲爱的孩子，我和你一样地惊慌无措，医师说，或许是花园中一只邪恶的毒虫，用毒液夺走了你父亲的生命。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"我能做的，就只有尽量给你留出与他独处的时间，让你与你的父亲做最后的告别。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"不要过度地悲伤，我亲爱的孩子，我还要出去告诉外面的人王宫的现状——我必须要先走了。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"......您去吧，您去吧......","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"呜......我的父亲，我的父亲......怎么会这样？谁能来告诉我？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3D/Avg_bg_bg_nobleN.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议论纷纷的人们","text":"......究竟是怎么回事......？","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"虽然王兄刚刚过世，全国上下都应该为此感到悲伤，但此刻我们也不得不为自身的利害着想。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"大家都知道，王子他自称能看到我们无法看到的事物，甚至能伸手触碰到祂——那奇特的“黑猫”。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"传说“黑猫”能带来爱与幸福，但有谁亲眼见证过这一点吗？有谁能确认，这不是国王为了掩护不祥之人所编造的故事？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"我们只需要在这里谈论事实，这使我不得不疑惑：是不是这个能看到他人所不能看到之物的不祥的孩子，给他的父亲带来了可悲的死亡？","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议论纷纷的人们","text":"是这样吗......？","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议论纷纷的人们","text":"难道小王子确实是个不祥之人......？国王突然暴毙，王后也陷入昏迷，只有他安然无恙，还常说自己能看到“黑猫”......","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"议论纷纷的人们","text":"啊，看，他出来了！","id":140},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":143},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"不，不是这样的......！","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"不是这样的！不是我害死的父亲，母亲是因为太过悲伤才昏迷......！","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"相信我，诸位，我一定会找到事情的真相！","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"喵？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"啊，“黑猫”......","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"你出现了......你......你带来的，到底是什么......？","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"（一如既往的沉默）","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"诸位！国家需要一位统治者。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"王子尚且年幼，王后已经昏迷......","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"国王的弟弟","text":"——请诸位拥立我成为新的王！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":164},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":169},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_bg_53_g8_sargondeluxeroom.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":172,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"——你这个无耻之人，我听说你当众宣布我的孩子不祥！","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"即使你趁着我昏迷，趁着他年幼，已然成为新的国王，我也仍旧要唾弃你！唾弃你这个偷走了王冠的窃贼！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"我清楚地知道，“黑猫”绝不是不祥的征兆，我的儿子也并非不祥，更不是他害死了自己的父亲！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"嘘，安静些，你哪还有一位王后的模样？我只会以为你是疯癫和痴狂的代名词，丈夫的死让你彻底失去了理智，你还想为你的儿子开脱！","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"我已经成了新的王，我说的话即是真理！","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"你这个可耻的败类！兄长死后不到一周你就坐上他的王座，辱骂他的妻子，污蔑他的儿子......我一定会指控你，是你杀死了我们的国王！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"你在胡说什么？！你看到了什么？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"——在你登基的时候，我掘开了他的坟墓，掀开了他的棺椁，我知道了你急匆匆将他下葬的原因......","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"他的胸前有一处匕首才能造成的伤口，你敢说你对此不知情？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"——！","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knife","id":197},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.7","g":"0.2","b":"0.2","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"——啊——","id":203},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"......你以为用我的死能够解决一切？","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"母亲，母亲！","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"我已经听到了他的声音，我的孩子，就要过来了......！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"母亲，母亲——","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":216},{"type":"multiline","name":"前王后","text":"呵，你没有机会挪动我的尸首了，我一定要让他亲眼见证你究竟做了什么——","id":217},{"type":"multiline","name":"前王后","text":"我的孩子，我在这里！！","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"该死！","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":221},{"type":"charslot","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——母亲！怎么回事，您怎么会变成这样？！","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"是不是都因为我？因为我能看到那只“黑猫”，因为我真的是个不祥之人？是我先害死了父亲，然后又是母亲您！","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"不，不是的......","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫摇晃着双尾，蹲坐在一旁。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"祂品尝到了哀伤，混杂着一个母亲对她儿子的怜惜与担忧。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"我的孩子，我想要告诉你，你并不是一个令你的父亲蒙羞的人，你所看到的“黑猫”，祂绝不像你叔父所说的那样是不祥的代言。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"为什么，母亲，您为什么这样笃定......？","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"我的孩子......因为在我身穿洁白的婚纱，与你父王沐浴在鲜花和祝福中，走入婚姻的殿堂时，我清楚地看到了祂。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"在我感到不适所以找来了医师，而医师告诉我你已经降临到我的腹中的时候，我也清楚地看到了祂......","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"在每一个感到无比幸福的瞬间，我都看到了祂......我看到了祂湛蓝的双眼，听到了祂舒适的微小咕噜声......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1493_1#1$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"我的孩子，请你一定要相信，祂是幸福的象征，是爱的使者，祂会惩治作恶的人......能看到祂的你，必定也是爱与幸福的结合......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1493_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"text","text":"王后的手渐渐垂了下去，她无力地抓住儿子的手。","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫跳开两步，跳上王宫的窗台，王后觉得，祂的目光似乎看向遥远的王宫外。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"呜喵。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"text","text":"小王子惊慌地看着这一切。他想要挽留住母亲的生命，他想要母亲能一直留在他的身边。","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"但他的母亲只是说——","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"孩子，快走吧！远远地离开这里......","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"是你的叔父杀了我，但你这么年幼，势单力薄，你能做得了什么呢？","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"离开那个王座上的窃贼，那个杀人的凶手，那个你无力抵抗的人......！","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"前王后","text":"快走，快走吧......！快走......","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——母亲，不，不，母亲......！","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"王后的手垂落在地上，砸进血泊中。","id":269},{"type":"text","text":"小王子抱着倒在鲜血中的母亲，他看向窗台上的黑猫，黑猫也回望他。","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"然后，他望向了自己的叔父——这个占有了王位的窃贼，杀害他母亲的凶手——已经整理好了仪容，面庞上浮起一抹微笑。","id":271},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"我的孩子。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"我不知道这一切都是如何发生的，我听到了声响，急匆匆地赶来，事情就已经变成了这样。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"我苦命的、可怜的孩子，我不会在意你的不祥，不会在意你带来的厄运，我相信我能够压倒和消解所有不幸，我希望你能成为我的孩子。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"这样，我们就是完美的国王与他的继承人了。你觉得怎么样？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"你——！","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":286},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫站在高高的宫殿上，看着这一切。","id":288},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":294},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_bg_bg_windows.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$dignified_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_dignified_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":297,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"嗬——嗬——","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"怎么会......事情怎么会这样？","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"但无人回答他的问题，回应他的只有一片死寂。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"簌簌，他听到风吹过的声响。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"咕咕，他听到羽兽在外面的天地中振翅，那翅膀扇动夜间渐渐升起的薄雾，让月亮的光芒照进他藏身的房间。","id":308},{"type":"text","text":"绝望、悲痛又满腔仇恨的小王子终于抵挡不住疲劳，歪倒在潮湿冰冷的地面上睡去。","id":309},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","duration":"2","id":311},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"......","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"父亲......父亲......？呜......父亲！","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"真的是你吗？是我在做梦，还是您的灵魂终于出现在了我的面前？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"我是游走在世间的灵魂，只能借着黑夜向你倾诉这些不为人知的秘密。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"请认真听我接下来的话，我的孩子，不要让哭泣占用了这宝贵的时间——","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"如果有人告诉你，是一只毒虫带走了我的生命，那你必然不能相信他，并一定要清楚地记得，他就是杀死我的凶手！","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——！","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"......阳光，清晨，我感受到了不属于我的气息，我要走了，我的孩子......","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1492_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奇异的鬼魂","text":"不要忘记我说的话......","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_npc_1492_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":334},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":335},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"果然是这样，果然是这样！我还要再向谁取证呢？我还要如何再确认呢？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我恨不得将这一切刻印在脚下的石板上，让它永远记住，就是我的叔父，害死了我的父亲，杀死了我的母亲，还将一切都怪责于我......！","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"charslot","id":343},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫不知何时已经走入他藏身的房间，祂蹲坐在高高的窗台上。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘优雅的生物","text":"喵？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我现在应该怎么办？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫自然不会回答他，黑猫只是摇晃着自己的双尾，安静地等待着他的下一句话。","id":351},{"type":"character","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"小王子，国王陛下让我给您带来金银珠宝，华贵的衣服，还有能安抚您饥饿肠胃的丰盛餐食。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"他请您务必收下，然后考虑他之前的提议。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）......我......我该怎么办？","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）大臣和百姓相信我不祥，父亲已死，母亲临死前告诉我，让我远远地逃走，因为我根本无力去完成复仇......","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）我能装聋作哑，假装自己不知道父母都是被谁所杀，接受他的邀请吗？","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）还是说我应拔剑而起，不顾一切杀死他？","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）我应该怎么做，谁能来回答我，谁能来告诉我？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）或许......或许......","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"text","text":"小王子伸出手，颤抖着伸向门锁。","id":374},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫好奇地歪歪头，双尾拍打着窗台。","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）......我......","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"国王陛下还说，他让您叫他，“父亲”。","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"（小声）“父亲”？","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——“父亲”？！","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":384},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$batmeeting_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_batmeeting_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":386,"musicid":4},{"type":"text","text":"小王子倏地收回了手。","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"“父亲”，这个被他看作与“神明”同义的词语，这个绝无可能被安在那个男人身上的称呼！","id":388},{"type":"dialog","id":389},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","volume":"0.5","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"8","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":391},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":394},{"type":"text","text":"小王子冷笑起来，他抽出宝剑，一剑劈开了房门，连带着门后被使者捧在手中的华服与珠宝。","id":395},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫站起身来，兴奋地望向拔剑的小王子，祂的眼睛少见地亮起，幽蓝如同夜空。","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——不，我不要再去想了！","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我不要再去想你到底是爱与幸福的使者，还是不祥与厄运的化身了！","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我所追寻的答案从不在你身上，而在于我自己！","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"我决定去杀死那个可耻的人！","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":405},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"text","text":"使者早已逃走，门前倾倒一地的华服与珠宝下，还有新国王为应对小王子的拒绝所准备的锁链和铁球。","id":407},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"他想用这铁链与铁球捆住我的手、我的脚、我的余生，我就用这铁链和铁球葬送他的性命。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"就是现在！","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":412},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫从窗台上跃下，展示出前所未有的兴趣。清晨的阳光洒下，让祂在地面上投下巨大的阴影，似乎是在为小王子引路。","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"一路引向王宫。","id":415},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":420},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":421},{"type":"charslot","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的大臣","text":"怎么回事？他怎么拿着利剑冲出来了？他要去哪，快拦住他！","id":423},{"type":"charslot","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的群众","text":"天啊，他哪里来这么大的力气......？！","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"小王子没有说话，他只是埋头向前奔跑着。","id":426},{"type":"text","text":"他跑出藏身的小房间，跑过自己儿时玩耍过的花园，跑过父母曾陪他练剑读诗的庭院，跑过他父母殒命的殿堂。","id":427},{"type":"text","text":"他跑到了那个窃得了王位的叔父面前。","id":428},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":430},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_bg_bg_nobleD.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":431},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"你来了，我的孩子，你是同意我的想法了吗？","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"不，你手上拿着宝剑，你——","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":437},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——受死吧！","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":440},{"type":"dialog","id":441},{"type":"text","text":"铁链原本要用来锁住小王子的双手，他就用这铁链紧紧地缠绕住这坐在王位上的窃贼的脖子。","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"铁球原本要用来牵绊住小王子的双脚，他就用这铁球狠狠地砸向这身穿华服的杀人犯的胸膛。","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"他接下来的命运被眼前的人用谎言与恶意钦定，他就用这谎言与恶意改写眼前人接下来的命运。","id":444},{"type":"text","text":"他将宝剑深深刺入眼前人的身体。","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"啊，啊！——来......人......！","id":447,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1490_1#1$1","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"新国王","text":"......快，快来......人......！！","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1490_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的士兵","text":"快，保护国王！","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的士兵","text":"保护国王！","id":453},{"type":"dialog","id":454},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"0.6","id":455},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":457},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"——受——死——吧！","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":460},{"type":"dialog","id":461},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"没有人有力气掰开那死死缠绕着的铁链，直到新国王被勒断脖子，被砸烂手脚与胸膛，终于从他死死抓住的王座上滑落到地面。","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"小王子也终于松开了他的手，露出了一个满足的笑容。","id":464},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1496_1#1$1","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"哈......哈......","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1496_1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":467},{"type":"dialog","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"但他随后也摸到了自己身上的鲜血——","id":469},{"type":"text","text":"士兵们的武器早已贯穿了他的胸膛，刺入了他的手脚，让他的鲜血也泼洒在地面上。","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"小王子艰难地喘着气，看向湛蓝的天空。","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"呜喵。","id":472},{"type":"text","text":"他再一次看到了那只黑猫。","id":473},{"type":"text","text":"他的耳边传来了各种各样的声音。","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是“黑猫”吧，就是“黑猫”吧？是祂蛊惑了他，让他变成了一个疯癫的人......不仅害死了父母，现在还杀死了想要收养他的叔父！","id":476},{"type":"charslot","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"可是，小王子不是说了吗？是现在的国王杀死了前国王和前王后，他是在为自己的父母复仇！","id":478},{"type":"charslot","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"谁能知道这是真是假呢？也可能是他突然发了疯，想出了这一套说辞让自己好受一点，为自己带来的厄运找借口。","id":480},{"type":"charslot","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"但不论怎么说，他都要死了......前国王和前王后，还有我们现在的国王，他们都死了。","id":482},{"type":"charslot","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"现在说的这一切，还有什么意义呢？","id":484},{"type":"charslot","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"是啊，还有什么意义呢？","id":486},{"type":"text","text":"呜喵。","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫迈着轻缓的步子，蹲坐在了他的身旁。","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"小王子用最后的力气看向祂，看向祂幽蓝的双眼。","id":489},{"type":"charslot","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"......你说......","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小王子","text":"......我做的这一切，是有意义的吗？","id":492},{"type":"character","id":493},{"type":"dialog","id":494},{"type":"text","text":"黑猫依旧没有回答，只是静静地看着他。","id":495},{"type":"dialog","id":496},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":497},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":498},{"type":"charslot","id":499},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":500},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_bg_bg_stage.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":501},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":502},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.4","id":503,"musicid":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"0.8","id":504},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#2$1","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"“......我做的这一切，是有意义的吗？”","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":508},{"type":"dialog","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩合上剧本。","id":510},{"type":"text","text":"那只神秘又美丽的生物远远地蹲坐在窗台上享受阳光，见卢西恩终于从剧本中抬头，她没有挪动脚步，只是有些好奇地投去了目光。","id":511},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘美丽的生物","text":"呜喵？","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#3$1","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......有意义吗？","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":516},{"type":"dialog","id":517},{"type":"text","text":"卢西恩低头沉思。","id":518},{"type":"text","text":"他看向身后的剧团。昨日在河中被乱石划破的伤痕泛起尖锐的痛楚，那是一场失败的逃跑。","id":519},{"type":"text","text":"他从喉间溢出一段压抑着狂热的曲调。那是一个已经在心中生根发芽，只待最终那一日降临的选择。","id":520},{"type":"text","text":"疼痛都如此鲜活，他不可察觉地微笑了起来。","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#3$1","id":522},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......结果不过是最后得到的一个答案。","id":523,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1832_1#3$1","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"选择从一开始就已经做出，无人能否定它的意义。","id":525,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D7/Avg_avg_npc_1832_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":526},{"type":"dialog","id":527},{"type":"text","text":"话音刚落，像是终于得到了一个期待许久的玩具，这只神秘而美丽的生物突然站了起来，兴奋地抖了抖双尾。","id":528},{"type":"text","text":"她的眼睛少见地亮起，幽蓝如同夜空。","id":529},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4198_christ_1#1$1","id":530},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.6","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":531},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘美丽的生物","text":"呜喵！","id":532,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4198_christ_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"character","id":533},{"type":"dialog","id":534},{"type":"text","text":"她轻快地跃到了卢西恩的桌子上，以一个几乎从未有过的亲昵姿态，用自己的脑袋蹭了蹭卢西恩，对着他缓慢地眨着眼睛。","id":535},{"type":"text","text":"夹杂着执拗的疯狂，克制的恨意，像是一团乱糟糟但急需品尝的猫草，一个毛茸茸的线球。她很喜欢这样的回答，她很喜欢这样的情绪。","id":536},{"type":"text","text":"这一次的故事，这一次眼前的这个人，会给她带来怎样美味的情绪呢？","id":537},{"type":"dialog","id":538},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":539},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":540},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":541},{"type":"character","id":542},{"type":"charslot","id":543},{"type":"image","id":544}],"characters":["神秘优雅的生物","婴儿","惊喜的仆从们","王后","国王","国王的弟弟","小王子","议论纷纷的人们","前王后","新国王","奇异的鬼魂","门外的声音","惊慌的大臣","紧张的群众","紧张的士兵","惊慌的士兵","？？？","卢西恩","神秘美丽的生物"]}